    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emutanata e nkaiguanani e Sheba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12.42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 11.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee ening'oo enkaiguanani e Sheba olnigo le Solomon, nelotu Yerusalem atem ninye too nkikilikuanat naagol. Nelotu ninye eeta ilaisiaayiak kumok o ntamesin naanapita isonkoyoni, o sahabu sapuk oleng, o soito oogol enkinyang'a. Ore ake pee elotu enetii Solomon, neliki ninye nena pooki apa naatii oltau lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal Solomon nkikilikuanat enyena pooki. Meetae entoki hoo nabo naisudoro to laiguanani Solomon neitu eibalakinye ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edol ina aiguanani e sheba eng'eno e Solomon, oina aji natesheta ninye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o endaa natii emisa enye, o ltonei loo lkituaak lenyena, o enkisiaayiare oo sinkan lenyena, o nkilani enye, o lanapak loo nkikompeni enye o nkilani enye, o lasarri lenyena oo pejori ooitayio ninye te nkaji o Laitoriani, eitu eitoki ninye aidim atejo ae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye olaiguanani, “Ekesipa olkilikuai apa latoning'o nanu te nkop ai makewan tialo mbaa inono o eng'eno ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu apa nanu anyorraa ilo kilikuai ometaba anaa nalotu adol too nkonyek aainei makewan, naa ng'ura, eitu apa nanu aalikini olpisiaai le ng'eno ino. Ilus iyie teilo kilikuai apa latoning'o nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emunyak siaake nkituaak inono o sinkan linono ooitashe te dukuya iyie anaake nening eng'eno ino! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meisisi Olaitoriani Enkai ino amu kitishipakine ninye iyie nikipik iyie olorika lenye le nkitoo pee iyaku olaiguanani te rishata o Laitoriani Enkai ino! Ore amu kenyor Olaitoriani Enkai ino Israel naa keitasheyie ninche ntarasi, kintaa ninye iyie olaiguanani lenye, pee itum aiguanayu te sipata o te supatisho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninye aisho olaiguanani shekeli iip o tikitam e sahabu, o sonkoyoni kumok, o soito oogol enkinyang'a: ooishoo enkaiguanani e Sheba olaiguanani Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo sinkan le Huram o sinkan le Solomon apa ooyautua sahabu naing'uaa Ofir neyau sii ilkeek ooji ilmusantali o soito oogol enkinyang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayunye Solomon lelo keek nkedeta naajing'ieki enkaji e Nkai o enkaji o laiguanani, o wululi loo usin, o nkinantani oo usin, tenkaraki lelo aranyak. Eitu aikata edoli embae naaijo ena te nkop e Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho Solomon enkaiguanani e Sheba nena pooki naayieu ninye, pooki toki ake ninye natoomonuo metii ntokitin naayaka ninye olaiguanani. Nerrinyo ninye alo enkop enye tenebo ilaisiaayiak lenyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Karsisisho o laiguanani Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkiroishi e sahabu nayauaki enetii olaiguanani Solomon naa ntalantani iip ile o ntomoni ile o ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena naayautua ilainyang'ak o lamirak, eyautua sii ilaiguanak pooki le Arabia o lbalusuni leina kop sahabu o enkosholai aayaki Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitobir olaiguanani ilong'oi iip are sapuki e sahabu naidong'oki, ore ake elong'o nabo naa shekeli iip ile e sahabu naidong'oki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aitobir ilong'oi iip uni e sahabu naidong'oki; naa shekeli iip uni e sahabu naidong'oki ake elong'o nabo. Nepik olaiguanani nena long'oi atua ina aji o sero le Lebanon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitobir sii olaiguanani olorika le nkitoo kitok loo lala loo lkanchaoni, nemur te sahabu nasila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeta ilo orika le nkitoo nkedeta ile o ewueji neiteleikini o nkejek e sahabu, neitatashakini ilo orika le nkitoo, ore ake enkalo nabo eilo orika le nkitoo netii ineeiteleikini Nkaik, o lng'atunyo oare ooitashe too mbat nena wuejitin neeiteleikini nkaik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe ake ilng'atunyo tomon oare teine, neitashe ake obo te nkalo e bayie e pooki kedet enena kedeta pokira ile, eitu aekata edoli entoki naaijo ina te pooki kitoria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ntokitin pooki naaokishoreki o laiguanani Solomon naa ine sahabu, ore imasaa pooki eina aji entim e Lebanon naa ine sahabu nasila. Meikenari apa enkosholai aajo toki too nkolong'i e Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kepuo apa imelin o laiguanani Tarshishi tenebo isinkan le Huram kata nabo te rishata oo larin okuni ore nena melin e Tarshish naa kepuonu apa enapita sahabu, o enkosholai, o lala loo lkanchaoni, o yekenyi o motonyi sidain naaijo ilukunkuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisulu Solomon ilaiguanak pooki le nkop te karsisisho o te ng'eno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'oru ilaiguanak pooki le nkop enetii Solomon ejo pee ening eng'eno enye natipika Enkai atua endamunoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ake pooki lenye enkishoroto, ntokitin e nkosholai o ne sahabu, o lkilani, o emanoo, o sonkoyoni, o mbartan o nyumpui te pooki ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
