            "sid": "2CH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa nkulie kiaasin e Solomon ebaiki enkiterunoto o metabaiki enkiting'oto neigeroki tiatua embuku oo nkatinin e Natan ilo oiboni le Nkai o tiatua e naibon e Ahija le Shilon, o too nduaat e Ido ilo aduaani, eipirta Yeroboam olayioni le Nebat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitoreishe apa Solomon te Yerusalem neitore Israel pooki ilarin artam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirrag Solomon etua anaa loo menye. Nenukari te nkanasa e Daudi papaai lenye. Neitoreisho Rehoboam olayioni lenye te rishata enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
